+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+This project's current recorded decision is an HTTPS-everywhere, no-plaintext-exception policy: all communication, regardless of source, destination, or environment (development, staging, production), must use HTTPS with certificate verification enabled, including communication between internal hosts.
